url: "https://boettiger-lab.github.io/data-workflows/"
abstract: >-
  Dataset processing workflows that turn disparate legacy and proprietary data
  into AI-ready, cloud-native data with rich STAC metadata — through an
  AI-driven pipeline powered by cng-datasets and autoscaled on NRP Kubernetes.
  One of three open-source components that make the cloud-native data stack
  reachable by the AI tools researchers already use.
